<title>UK: Scottish &amp; Newcastle squeezed higher.</title>
<headline>Scottish &amp; Newcastle squeezed higher.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Scottish &amp; Newcastle Plc were squeezed higher as investors turned their attention to defensive domestic stocks that have underperformed the recent broad advance, analysts and market makers said.</p>
<p>The shares firmed 19p to 675 by 1455.</p>
</text>
